      "created_at": "2019-04-02T01:05:23.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I was wondering could I have a Minion Maker archetype villain where their minions turned into debuffs when killed? I like the idea of instead of trying to overwelm the party with a million monsters the boss could only have a few out but the heroes have to be careful with how many they kill.&nbsp;</p>",
